[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0010","text":"──观众开始入场了——\n各位请做好各自准备——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0020","text":"终于要开始了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0030","text":"嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0040","text":"队形的事……\n等制作人回来之后……再说吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0050","text":"我们的话……一定能做到\n没问题的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0060","text":"…………\n没问题────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0080","text":"……呐\n要不要……围个圆阵？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0090","text":"体育比赛之前不是会做那个嘛\n大家围成一个圈──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0100","text":"……就这样把手伸向中间\n一起喊“嘿呀嘿呀哦”或者“Let's go”之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0110","text":"也不错呢\n……试试看？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0120","text":"嗯、嗯……！\n把手伸出来……那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0130","text":"怎么办，我想尽量想一个原创的！\n只属于illumination STARS的暗号！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0140","text":"比如说……\nIllumination，Stars！　之类的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0150","text":"……那不就是把组合名喊出来而已吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0160","text":"唔……\n你有什么想法吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0170","text":"突然被问到也……\n要是提前告诉我的话我就想了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0180","text":"抱歉～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0182","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0190","text":"我，想和illumination STARS的大家一起闪耀\n三个人一起……！成为最闪耀的偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0200","text":"当然！我们的话，一定能闪耀的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0210","text":"我们的，光辉──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0220","text":"────喂——大家！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0230","text":"马上就到你们出场了\n准备好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0240","text":"没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0250","text":"……好\n那么，这是我最后要说的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0260","text":"今天来到这里的人，\n都是想要为你们三人加油的人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0270","text":"所以放松一点……\n带着从观众席接收心意的感觉去面对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0280","text":"这样的话，你们三人的心意……\n光辉，也一定能传达给观众的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0290","text":"接收观众席的光辉，\n我们也……传递出去──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0300","text":"……不错呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0310","text":"嗯……呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0320","text":"谢谢你，制作人！\n还有，我们也有话要说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0330","text":"啊……那个……\n队形舞蹈────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0340","text":"昨天大家一起商量了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0350","text":"预备……请让我们挑战一下！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0360","text":"……嗯。加油去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0370","text":"……！\n好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0371","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0380","text":"……暗号"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0381","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0382","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0390","text":"────真乃\n……没问题吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0400","text":"嗯、嗯……！\n那么……要上了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0401","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0410","text":"……没问题的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0420","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0421","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0430","text":"──将光芒传递给大家吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0441","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_05_0440","text":"Illumination……Stars……！"}]
